Firstly, note that glass can be broken.  Where have you heard shattering sounds
before?

Also, most (but not all) gems are hard.  But all glass is soft.

There is a potion of enlightenment here.  Quaff it? [y/n]

You rise up, through the ceiling...

First, get one gem and (E)ngrave with it.  If it writes "in the dust", (N)ame it
"soft".  If it "engraves into the floor", it's a gem; (N)ame it "$$$".

Cart it around until you find a box or a chest.

Now, (N)ame the "soft" gems "glass", and put one of each into the chest.  Kick it.
Lots.  About twenty times.  You should hear the glass shattering.

Anything left in the box is a (soft) gem; name it "$$$".  Anything which has broken
was glass, but you (N)amed it glass before you even put it into the box.

That's it.  Now you can use an identify scroll on the (known) gems, so you get
full credit for throwing them at unicorns...

